        "original_id": "f2f99cd8-5c9f-55d8-b06a-1af9c1f3dcef",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: John Dyer Baizley, Gina Gleason, Pete Adams, Cy Twombly\n- Organizations: Baroness\n- Places: Savannah, Georgia; Lexington, Virginia\n- Products: In Return (Torche EP)\n\nFacts:\n- Baroness is an American heavy metal band from Savannah, Georgia, and its original members grew up together in Lexington, Virginia.\n- John Dyer Baizley, a singer for Baroness, created the artwork and design for In Return, a Torche EP.\n- Gina Gleason is the current lead guitarist for Baroness, replacing Pete Adams.\n- Cy Twombly died at age 77 in Savannah, Georgia.",
